OL,3,ABurnham says united Ireland poll is
OL,4,A'off the table' during first NI visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has said a united Ireland
OL,7,Freferendum is "off the table", during
OL,8,Fhis first visit to Northern Ireland
OL,9,Fsince becoming prime minister.
OL,11,F"We've got to focus on bringing people
OL,12,Ftogether as best we can, and I think
OL,13,Fwe've lived through a decade where
OL,14,Fthere's been a referendum on Brexit, we
OL,15,Fhad Scottish independence just before
OL,16,Fit," he said.
OL,18,FHe said the "rifts that come from those
OL,19,Fsituations take a long time to heal,
OL,20,Fand it sets you right back and you
OL,21,Fcan't focus on what's right in front of
OL,22,Fus here and now".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
