OL,3,ABurnham says united Ireland poll is
OL,4,A'off the table' during first NI visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham is spending time in Belfast
OL,7,Fhearing from young people before
OL,8,Fmeeting Stormont's first and deputy
OL,9,Ffirst ministers.
